       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "A package billing code or bundle code used to group products and services to a particular health condition (such as heart attack) which is based on a predetermined grouping code system." ] ;
       fhir:ElementDefinition.comment [ fhir:value "For example DRG (Diagnosis Related Group) or a bundled billing code. A patient may have a diagnosis of a Myocardial Infarction and a DRG for HeartAttack would be assigned. The Claim item (and possible subsequent claims) would refer to the DRG for those line items that were for services related to the heart attack event." ] ;
       fhir:ElementDefinition.requirements [ fhir:value "Required to relate the current  diagnosis to a package billing code that is then referenced on the individual claim items which are specific to the health condition covered by the package code." ] ;
