       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "應在 coding 填入長照照顧組合值集的代碼。A 單位個案管理服務應填入 AA00，並續填服務項目、服務對象與服務內容。" ] ;
       fhir:ElementDefinition.comment [ fhir:value "If this is an actual service or product line, i.e. not a Group, then use code to indicate the Professional Service or Product supplied (e.g. CTP, HCPCS, USCLS, ICD10, NCPDP, DIN, RxNorm, ACHI, CCI). If a grouping item then use a group code to indicate the type of thing being grouped e.g. 'glasses' or 'compound'." ] ;
